  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name="Story (6 charts)">
      <style />
      <size maxheight='768' maxwidth='1366' minheight='768' minwidth='1366' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
        <zone h='9600' id='11' type='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='400'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='20'>Late deliveries are linked to about 3,110 bad reviews; </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='20'>sellers shipping late is the biggest fixable cause</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Orders bought Jan 2017 to Aug 2018  ·  94,931 delivered orders  ·  6,518 late (6.87%)  ·  late = arrived after the promised day</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14600' id='12' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1  COST</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='27'>≈3,110</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>1-2 star reviews linked to late delivery</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>estimate, range 2,880 to 3,350  ·  26.7% of all 11,635 1-2 star reviews</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='11400' id='13' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>2  THIS MONTH VS GOAL</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='22'>6.3%</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>▲ Aug 2018 late rate, 1.9 points over the 4.4% goal</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='3200' id='14' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='21600'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='11'>▲ ABOVE GOAL  ·  under the warning line (8.4%)</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2B01E' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14600' id='15' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>3  SELLER SHIPS LATE</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='27'>21.2%</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>of orders shipped after the ship-by date arrive late, vs 5.4% shipped by it</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>27.8% of all late orders were shipped late by the seller</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='16' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>1  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>Reviews turn bad fast: 8.7% are 1-2 stars up to the promised day, about 78% from day 6 late</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>share of reviews that are 1-2 stars, by days past the promised day</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='21600' id='17' name="Review ramp" show-title='false' w='32000' x='1000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='18' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>2  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>Late rate sits above the 4.4% goal; Nov 2017, Feb 2018 and Mar 2018 went past the warning line</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>gray line = warning line, set for each month  ·  dots = months past it</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='21600' id='19' name="Trend" show-title='false' w='32000' x='34000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='20' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>3  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='12'>Orders shipped after the ship-by date: 21.2% arrive late, vs 5.4% when shipped by it</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>1,809 of 8,530 arrived late  ·  27.8% of all 6,518 late orders</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='21600' id='21' name="Handoff" show-title='false' w='32000' x='67000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='12400' id='22' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='56200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>4  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>117 sellers (20% of the 583) shipped late in 3 or more months and account for 56% of the 1,809 late orders that were shipped late</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>by number of months the seller shipped late  ·  Click a bar to filter</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='23800' id='23' name="Sellers" show-title='false' w='32000' x='1000' y='68600'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='24' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='56200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>5  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>North and northeast run 12.2% late vs 6.2% elsewhere</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>late rate by region  ·  Click a region to filter</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14000' id='25' name="Region" show-title='false' w='32000' x='34000' y='65200'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='26' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='56200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>6  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>48.3% of late orders came in 3 months: Nov 2017, Feb 2018 and Mar 2018</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>those 3 months held 21.7% of all orders (15% of months)</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='27200' id='27' name="Months" show-title='false' w='32000' x='67000' y='65200'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='6800' id='28' type='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='93100'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Two fixes to test next (nothing run yet)</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>      ·      What-if, not a result: if late-shipped orders were late as rarely as the rest, the rate would be 3.4%.</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1) Remind sellers of the ship-by date. We&apos;ll track the share of orders shipped late.      2) Add buffer days to promised dates in the north and northeast. We&apos;ll track late rate and average stars.</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-color' value='#555555' /><format attr='border-style' value='dashed' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{1D9BDA9F-A774-D668-EB7B-75B66C2536FF}' />
    </dashboard>
  </dashboards>
